  - m_Id: 46294704754689
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD654\uC0C1]] tick interval {{pos:reduced by {0:0}%}}
      (interval {{val:{1:0.##}s}})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754690
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD654\uC0C1 \uD53C\uD574]] coefficient {{pos:+{0:0}%p}}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754691
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD654\uC0C1]] application {{pos:+{0}}}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754692
    m_Localized: "\u25CF First [[\uD654\uC0C1]] on an enemy without [[\uD654\uC0C1]]
      {{pos:+{0} stacks}}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754693
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD654\uC0C1 \uD53C\uD574]] benefits from critical chance
      and critical damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754694
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD654\uC0C1]] {{pos:+{1:0}%}} per {{val:{0} stacks}}
      of [[\uD654\uC0C1 \uD53C\uD574]] on the target\n\u25CF Up to {{val:{2:0}%}}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754695
    m_Localized: "\u25CF If the target has no [[\uD654\uC0C1]], inflict {{val:{0}
      stacks}} of [[\uD654\uC0C1]]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754696
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Create a {{em:Sun Fragment}} every {{val:{0:0.##}s}}\n\u25CF
      Maintain up to {{val:{1}}}\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754697
    m_Localized: "\u25CF On contact, deal {{val:100%}} [[\uD654\uC5FC \uD53C\uD574]]
      and apply {{val:{0} stacks}} of [[\uD654\uC0C1]], then vanish"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754698
    m_Localized: Without a Lightning Mark, sweep ahead and fire stored {em:Recovered
      Spears}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46294704754699
    m_Localized: "Rush to a [[\uB099\uB8B0 \uD45C\uC2DD]] near the cursor and attack
      enemies along the path. Consume the mark to reset the skill and gain a {em:Recovered
      Spear}."
