  - m_Id: 50606285688877
    m_Localized: Stagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688878
    m_Localized: Swings the sword repeatedly. The final attack advances forward with
      a wide slash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688879
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Swing the sword for {val:3 consecutive} melee attacks\n\u25CF
      The third attack advances farther with a wide slash"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688880
    m_Localized: Hold and release to spin and slash nearby enemies. Requires sufficient
      charge; charging longer increases range and power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688881
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Hold to charge, then release for a {em:Spinning Slash}\n\u25CF
      Releasing at 50% or less cancels; above 50% attacks\n\u25CF Charging increases
      {pos:damage and attack range}\n\u25CF At max charge: about {val:1.67x} damage
      and {val:2x} size compared to minimum charge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688882
    m_Localized: Charges in the aimed direction and thrusts at enemies ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688883
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {em:Charge} in the aimed direction and thrust at enemies
      ahead"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688884
    m_Localized: "Fires a fireball that damages enemies around the impact point and
      inflicts [[\uD654\uC0C1]]."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688885
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Fire a fireball in the aimed direction\n\u25CF Deal area
      damage equal to [[\uD654\uC5FC \uD53C\uD574]] around the impact point and inflict
      {val:3 stacks} of [[\uD654\uC0C1]]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688886
    m_Localized: "Creates a large explosion at the chosen location after a short
      delay. Consumes all enemy [[\uD654\uC0C1]] stacks; more stacks mean more power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688887
    m_Localized: Explodes at the cursor after 0.6 seconds. Deals damage based on
      fire attack power and consumes all burn stacks for additional damage per stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688888
    m_Localized: "Consumes some [[\uD654\uC0C1]] stacks on burning enemies in view
      to trigger explosions. Nearby enemies also take damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688889
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Trigger explosions on all enemies with [[\uD654\uC0C1]]
      in view\n\u25CF Consume up to {val:5 stacks} of [[\uD654\uC0C1]] per target
      for explosion damage\n\u25CF Nearby enemies take the same damage\n\u25CF Explosion
      diameter: {val:5 tiles}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688890
    m_Localized: Dashes quickly in the movement direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688891
    m_Localized: Slashes repeatedly amid scattered petals. The final attack advances
      farther with a powerful slash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688892
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Scatter petals with {val:3 consecutive} slashes\n\u25CF
      The third attack advances farther with a powerful slash"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688893
    m_Localized: "During [[\uAC1C\uD654]], rapidly chains wide slashes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688894
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Basic attacks become wide slashes during [[\uAC1C\uD654]]\n\u25CF
      Each slash changes shape to avoid overlapping the previous attack\n\u25CF Can
      be chained rapidly at short intervals"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688895
    m_Localized: "Briefly enters [[\uAC1C\uD654]], increasing attack power, attack
      speed and movement speed. Basic attacks become wide slashes, and dashes leave
      slashes along the path."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688896
    m_Localized: "Attacks repeatedly with a lightning spear to build up [[\uC804\uAE30
      \uC18D\uC131]]."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606285688897
    m_Localized: Spends all remaining ammo in a fan-shaped barrage. Bullets knock
      enemies back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883136
    m_Localized: Cannot attack without ammo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883137
    m_Localized: Cannot attack without ammo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883138
    m_Localized: Spends ammo to fire a bullet that knocks enemies back. Cannot attack
      without ammo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883139
    m_Localized: Throws the weapon to damage and knock back enemies. The thrown weapon
      is {neg:lost permanently}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883140
    m_Localized: Swings the sword repeatedly to attack enemies ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883141
    m_Localized: 'Basic attacks have a <color=#8A5A10>10% chance</color>

      to
      deal <color=#197A67>3x damage</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883142
    m_Localized: '<color=#A8324A>Damage taken x2</color>

      <color=#197A67>Attack
      speed +40%</color>

      <color=#197A67>Movement speed +20%</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883143
    m_Localized: '<color=#8A5A10>On level up</color>, <color=#197A67>restore 2 HP</color>

      If
      you have taken no damage,

      <color=#197A67>max HP +1</color> (up to 3
      times)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883144
    m_Localized: '<color=#A8324A>Direct damage -20%</color>

      <color=#197A67>Electric
      buildup +25%</color>

      <color=#197A67>Electric proc damage +2</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883145
    m_Localized: 'Defeat 5 enemies within 5 seconds to gain

      <color=#197A67>attack
      speed +20%</color> for 5 seconds

      Kills during the effect reset its duration'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883146
    m_Localized: '<color=#8A5A10>Every 20 enemies defeated</color>

      <color=#197A67>restore
      1 HP</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883147
    m_Localized: '<color=#8A5A10>On enemy kill</color>

      remaining weapon cooldowns

      <color=#197A67>reduced
      by 5%</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883148
    m_Localized: '<color=#8A5A10>On selection, for every 3 current levels</color>

      <color=#197A67>max
      hearts +1</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883149
    m_Localized: '<color=#8A5A10>When 6 minutes or less remain</color>

      <color=#197A67>Movement
      speed +40%</color>

      <color=#197A67>Attack speed +25%</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883150
    m_Localized: '<color=#A8324A>Weapon slot 2 sealed</color>

      <color=#197A67>Attack
      power +25%</color>

      Weapon 1 cooldowns

      <color=#197A67>reduced
      by 25%</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883151
    m_Localized: '<color=#A8324A>Direct damage -20%</color>

      <color=#197A67>Burn
      inflicted +2</color>

      <color=#197A67>Burn damage +30%</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883152
    m_Localized: 'Using a potion grants <color=#2474D2>Woohoo!</color> for 15 seconds.

      <color=#2474D2>Woohoo!</color>:
      movement speed +30%, attack speed +15%'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883153
    m_Localized: Each potion used increases attack speed by 2%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883154
    m_Localized: 'Randomly select <color=#8A5A10>up to 3</color>

      relics that
      can be upgraded

      <color=#197A67>Each relic gains +1 level</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883155
    m_Localized: <color=#197A67>Gain 3 temporary hearts</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883156
    m_Localized: 'When burn damage defeats an enemy,

      inflict <color=#197A67>3
      burn</color>

      on the nearest enemy in view

      Cooldown: 0.5 seconds'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883157
    m_Localized: '<color=#A8324A>Max HP -2</color>

      Taking damage 4 times lifts
      the curse

      and grants, over the original maximum,

      <color=#197A67>max
      HP +2</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883158
    m_Localized: '<color=#A8324A>Direct damage -15%</color>

      Defeat 10 enemies
      with burn damage to lift the curse

      <color=#197A67>Burn damage +25%</color>

      <color=#197A67>Burn
      inflicted +1</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883159
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Enter {em:Bloom}\n\u25CF For {val:3 seconds}: {pos:normal
      damage} {val:+25}, {pos:attack speed} {val:+2.5}, {pos:movement speed} {val:+60%}\n\u25CF
      Basic attacks become {em:wide Full Bloom Slashes}\n\u25CF [[\uB300\uC2DC]]
      becomes faster and creates {val:3} slashes along the path\n\u25CF With the
      exclusive relic, kills {pos:extend duration} by {val:+1 second}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883160
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Perform {val:3 consecutive} thrusts and downward strikes
      with a lightning spear\n\u25CF Each attack builds up [[\uC804\uAE30 \uC18D\uC131]]\n\u25CF
      The final hit applies heavy pressure ahead"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883161
    m_Localized: "Charges to a [[\uB099\uB8B0 \uD45C\uC2DD]] and gains a {em:Recovered
      Spear}. Without a mark, sweeps ahead and fires stored spears."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883162
    m_Localized: "\u25CF With a [[\uB099\uB8B0 \uD45C\uC2DD]] near the cursor, becomes
      {em:Thunder Spear Charge}\n\u25CF Without a mark, attacks ahead with {em:Thunder
      Spear Sweep}\n\u25CF A successful mark charge {pos:resets Thunder Spear Charge
      cooldown}\n\u25CF Gain {val:1} {em:Recovered Spear}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883163
    m_Localized: "Drops lightning spears nearby to deal damage and leave [[\uB099\uB8B0
      \uD45C\uC2DD]]s. Marks serve as targets for {em:Thunder Spear Charge}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883164
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Create {val:6} [[\uB099\uB8B0 \uD45C\uC2DD]]s in the combat
      area around you\n\u25CF Spears deal light landing damage; marks last {val:7
      seconds}\n\u25CF Use the marks as {em:Thunder Spear Charge} targets"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883165
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Spend all remaining ammo on a {em:barrage}\n\u25CF Each
      bullet deals {val:100 fixed damage} and knockback\n\u25CF Fire at {val:0.08-second}
      intervals with a {val:15-degree} spread\n\u25CF After use: {neg:0 ammo remaining}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883166
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Spend {val:1 remaining round} to fire a straight bullet\n\u25CF
      The bullet deals {val:100 fixed damage} and knockback\n\u25CF Without ammo,
      switches to {neg:Dry Fire}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883167
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Throw {em:Odd Iron} to deal {val:60 fixed damage} and knock
      enemies back\n\u25CF The weapon disappears and {neg:cannot be recovered}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883168
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Accelerate immediately, then gain further speed in stages
      while maintained\n\u25CF On use / after {val:3 seconds} / after {val:6 seconds}:
      [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]] bonus {val:100% / 200% / 300%}\n\u25CF {em:Forced
      movement toward the mouse}\n\u25CF Taking damage, colliding with an enemy or
      attacking {neg:immediately ends acceleration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883169
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Perform a high-speed slash ahead\n\u25CF Damage bonus equal
      to [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]] {val:x3}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883170
    m_Localized: Moonlit chill flows along the blade, leaving a cold breath where
      it cuts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883171
    m_Localized: A state of Bloom that pours a lifetime's essence into a single instant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883172
    m_Localized: The sun's lingering heat remains wherever the blade passes, as though
      its tip still breathes with warmth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883173
    m_Localized: Intoxication spreads from the tips of your toes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883174
    m_Localized: At the moment of impact, a jarring reflex surges through your legs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883175
    m_Localized: The moment you cut down an enemy, a light, sharp momentum lingers
      in your legs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883176
    m_Localized: Your steps grow lighter as the numbers disappear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883177
    m_Localized: Dense darkness obscures your vision, forcing you to watch your footing
      closely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883178
    m_Localized: Shadow mist veils your sight, making it difficult to distinguish
      your surroundings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883179
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Restore {pos:[+1]} [[\uCCB4\uB825]]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883180
    m_Localized: Creates a feather that orbits you. Deals 35/45/55/65/75% of attack
      power as damage depending on level, and orbits faster with higher movement
      speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883181
    m_Localized: Non-critical hits increase critical chance by 2/3/4%. Stacks up
      to 8 times and resets on a critical hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606289883182
    m_Localized: 'Exclusive relic for Bloom

      Defeating an enemy during Bloom
      extends its duration by 1 second.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271744
    m_Localized: 'Exclusive relic for Wings of Afterimage

      Defeating an enemy
      with Speed Strike prevents Rush from ending.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271745
    m_Localized: '[On critical hit] [Movement speed] +2%

      Stacks up to 50%

      [Resets
      when taking damage]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271746
    m_Localized: 'Exclusive relic for Wings of Afterimage

      Increases Rush''s
      movement speed bonus

      On using Rush: [Movement speed] +150%

      After
      3 seconds: [Movement speed] +150% more

      After another 3 seconds: [Movement
      speed] +200% more'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271747
    m_Localized: Critical hits increase critical chance by 4/6/8/10/12% for 3 seconds.
      Further critical hits reset the duration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271748
    m_Localized: "\u25CF While HP is at least {min_ratio}: [[{stat}]] {value}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271749
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uCE58\uBA85\uD0C0]] increases [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      by {move_speed_gain}\n\u25CF Stacks up to {max_move_speed_bonus}\n\u25CF Taking
      damage {neg:resets accumulated bonuses}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271750
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271751
    m_Localized: "\u25CF While HP is at most {max_ratio}: [[{stat}]] {value}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271752
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271753
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271754
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271755
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271756
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271757
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271758
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uBC1B\uC73C\uBA74]]: [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      {move_speed_bonus} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271759
    m_Localized: "<color=#96DCFA>\u201CEnsure sufficient distance before use.\u201D\nIts
      previous owner considered \u201Csufficient\u201D a subjective concept.</color>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271760
    m_Localized: <color=#96DCFA>A flower blooms its deepest red just before its last
      breath. Bloom holds that fleeting moment upon the blade.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271761
    m_Localized: <color=#96DCFA>Before the dazzling flash crosses your vision, the
      enemy line has already been pierced.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271762
    m_Localized: <color=#96DCFA>No reloading. Once the six shots are spent, all that
      remains is to throw this odd lump of iron.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271763
    m_Localized: "<color=#96DCFA>\u201COnce a knight's wings begin to beat, they
      never stop. Only victory or utter destruction can bring them to an end.\u201D</color>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271764
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Hero's Sword}\n\u25CF {pos:Charging
      Thrust available} while charging Spinning Slash\n\u25CF Thrust damage, size
      and color scale with charge at activation\n\u25CF At max charge, thrust damage
      is about {val:1.67x}\n\u25CF Release during the charge to chain into an {em:Enhanced
      Spinning Slash}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271765
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Crimson Limit}\n\u25CF Kills with
      {em:Ignite!} create {val:1} {em:Homing Fireball} at the target's location\n\u25CF
      The fireball tracks a nearby enemy\n\u25CF No target means no fireball; homing
      fireballs {neg:cannot create further fireballs}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271766
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Crimson Limit}\n\u25CF {em:Mega
      Explosion!} becomes a {em:giant piercing lava ball}\n\u25CF Retains Mega Explosion!'s
      damage and size\n\u25CF Travels at {val:75%} of basic attack projectile speed\n\u25CF
      Disappears on contact with a wall"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271767
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Thunder Spear Galaron}\n\u25CF Lightning
      Marks fall sequentially at enemy positions at {val:0.07-second} intervals\n\u25CF
      If blocked or too close to another spear, fall at an empty location near the
      enemy"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271768
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Thunder Spear Galaron}\n\u25CF [[\uACF5\uACA9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      {pos:[+20%]}\n\u25CF The {val:third hit} of a basic attack drops {val:1} thunder
      spear toward an enemy near the attack's endpoint"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50606298271769
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Odd Iron}\n\u25CF Attack or {em:barrage}
      input reloads when out of ammo\n\u25CF Reloading consumes {val:1} relic level
      for a {pos:full magazine}\n\u25CF Press again after reloading to fire\n\u25CF
      Relic level represents remaining reloads\n\u25CF At level {val:0}, the {neg:relic
      disappears}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708166434816
    m_Localized: Welcome, hero. The Demon King's audience chamber is just ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458240
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, audiences are unavailable at present. His Majesty
      is catching up on paperwork.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458241
    m_Localized: To be precise... a great deal of paperwork.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458242
    m_Localized: His Majesty asked me to give you this message.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458243
    m_Localized: "\u201CIt is too soon. Explore the castle further and earn the officers'
      recognition.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458244
    m_Localized: Our officers can be found in each of the three regions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458245
    m_Localized: Earn recognition from three of them, and this door will open for
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458246
    m_Localized: Of course... I cannot guarantee they are at their posts. This castle
      is a surprisingly flexible workplace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458247
    m_Localized: Then I wish you good luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458248
    m_Localized: The requirements have been met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458249
    m_Localized: You may now have your audience with the Demon King.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458250
    m_Localized: At last, the door opens. I was growing bored through what felt like
      an eternity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458251
    m_Localized: First, allow me to commend you for coming this far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458252
    m_Localized: Are you the Demon King?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458253
    m_Localized: What did you do to my dear friend who came before me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458254
    m_Localized: Your friend. You mean the hero? How painfully trite... She is...
      well...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458255
    m_Localized: <color=purple>Bwahahahahaha--!</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458256
    m_Localized: ...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708296458257
    m_Localized: That's a rather strange laugh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846848
    m_Localized: ....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846849
    m_Localized: (The Demon King lightly tapped the sword with a fist, as if scolding
      it. The sword shuddered.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846850
    m_Localized: Ahem. In any case, you are far too weak to find her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846851
    m_Localized: Let me show you the difference in our strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846852
    m_Localized: As you can see, you are pitifully weak. You fall far short of reaching
      this throne.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846853
    m_Localized: But I am a generous Demon King. Watching a bird struggle with broken
      wings is another act of my mercy. I shall cast you into that distant pit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846854
    m_Localized: Claw your way back from that deep, dark pit. If you pass my servants
      and reach me again, I will face you as many times as you wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846855
    m_Localized: But my patience is like sand falling to the bottom of an hourglass.
      Exactly 15 minutes. Show me the resolve to reach me before it runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846856
    m_Localized: Then I look forward to our next meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846857
    m_Localized: Are you the hero? What's with that scrawny body! You dare challenge
      His Majesty like that? Admirable spirit, but you need a lot more training!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846858
    m_Localized: You want to knock His Majesty down? I like that absurdly lofty goal!
      The higher your sights, the higher your body can climb!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846859
    m_Localized: Good! Buffy will train you personally! Pick one of the three machines
      beside me and get moving! Go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846860
    m_Localized: At last, hero. [pause=0.25]Hehe, you sure [punch]took your time[/punch].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846861
    m_Localized: So, what do you think? Your oldest childhood friend is the [punch]Demon
      King[/punch] now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846862
    m_Localized: What the...! Were you brainwashed or something?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846863
    m_Localized: ...That outfit really doesn't suit you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846864
    m_Localized: Now that's the reaction I wanted~ [pause=0.2]Relax, nobody brainwashed
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846865
    m_Localized: Well, I have my reasons too. [pause=0.25]I just can't tell you yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846866
    m_Localized: '[shake]Whaaat!?![/shake] What kind of reaction is that?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846867
    m_Localized: I spent ages picking it out! At least [punch]give me a compliment[/punch]!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846868
    m_Localized: ...Anyway... [pause=0.35]I won't go easy on you. I am the Demon
      King, after all. [pause=0.2]Come on, [punch]let's dance[/punch], hero!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708304846869
    m_Localized: ...Are you the hero?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041152
    m_Localized: I am Spiri. The dragon of crimson calamity... [pause=0.25]Spiri.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041153
    m_Localized: I do not understand. From you... [pause=0.35]I smell nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041154
    m_Localized: No fear. No bloodlust. Not even the will to survive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041155
    m_Localized: ...Are you truly that weak? [pause=0.25]Or have you already made
      your peace?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041156
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041157
    m_Localized: ...Forgive me, but could you wait a moment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041158
    m_Localized: At present, I am... [pause=0.35]not in a particularly desirable
      state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041159
    m_Localized: (<size=110%>Gulp</size>)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041160
    m_Localized: (<size=115%>Gulp</size>)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041161
    m_Localized: (<size=110%>Gulp</size><size=115%>Gulp</size><size=120%>Gulp gulp--!!</size>)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041162
    m_Localized: '[slowshake][rand_size=95,112]Pwaaaaaah----[/rand_size][/slowshake]!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041163
    m_Localized: '[slowshake][rand_size=95,110]Aaaah~[/rand_size][/slowshake]! Human
      [rand_size=95,108]booze[/rand_size] really is the best~! I feel [rand_size=95,106]alive[/rand_size]
      again~!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041164
    m_Localized: Oooh~ Hero! You're [slowshake][rand_size=95,110]still heeere[/rand_size][/slowshake]~!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041165
    m_Localized: Come on, don't be so stiff~ [pause=0.2]Have a [rand_size=95,108]drink[/rand_size]!
      Fighting is best when you're [slowshake]drunk[/slowshake], you know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041166
    m_Localized: What on earth was that just now...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041167
    m_Localized: All right. I'd never turn down a drink!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041168
    m_Localized: Just now~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041169
    m_Localized: Ehehe... [pause=0.25][slowshake][rand_size=95,108]Who knooows[/rand_size][/slowshake]~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041170
    m_Localized: Pretend you didn't see it~ [pause=0.2]I don't want to [rand_size=95,105]remember[/rand_size]
      it either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041171
    m_Localized: Ooooh~!! You're [slowshake][rand_size=95,112]my kind of company[/rand_size][/slowshake]~!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041172
    m_Localized: Great, great! Today calls for a special [rand_size=95,108]hero's
      welcome drink[/rand_size]~!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041173
    m_Localized: Huh. [pause=0.25]Why do I see [slowshake][rand_size=95,108]three
      hands[/rand_size][/slowshake]?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041174
    m_Localized: Well, I'm [rand_size=95,108]warmed up[/rand_size] now. Shall we
      [slowshake]get started[/slowshake]~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041175
    m_Localized: We need to finish [rand_size=95,106]before I sober up[/rand_size].
      [pause=0.2]Let's not drag this out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041176
    m_Localized: Otherwise, things around here get a little [slowshake][rand_size=95,110]dangerous[/rand_size][/slowshake]!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041177
    m_Localized: Weapons, relics, I've got everything you could want! Just don't
      ask where I got it, hehe!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708309041178
    m_Localized: Ooh, you've got a good eye! These are treasures carefully selected
      from the Demon King's castle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708321624064
    m_Localized: Who owned them a moment ago doesn't matter, right? They're mine
      now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708321624065
    m_Localized: Whaaat?! You're really leaving?! W-wait! Looking is free, so stay
      a little longer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708321624066
    m_Localized: Keep looking and you'll definitely find something you want!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708321624067
    m_Localized: Hey, you in the helmet. Yes, you, wandering all over the place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818368
    m_Localized: The castle layout changed again. Just when I learn my way around,
      this happens. Now deliveries are piling up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818369
    m_Localized: If you're heading to the next region anyway, could you take some
      parcels from that pile? Just put them in the delivery box there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818370
    m_Localized: Take only what fits in your bag. Three is plenty. Any more and they'll
      think I'm slacking off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818371
    m_Localized: But see each one through to delivery. Someone's waiting eagerly
      for it, so don't abandon it on the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818372
    m_Localized: I'm not asking for free. I'll give you something valuable for each
      parcel. Worth a try, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818373
    m_Localized: I'll sort out the rest here. Take them when you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818374
    m_Localized: ...Demon King's army... [pause=0.25]Chloe, shadow spirit and Silent
      Warden. ...Go back. This... isn't a place for your kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818375
    m_Localized: ...Don't come closer. If you touch my shadow and something happens...
      [tremble]I won't be responsible[/tremble].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818376
    m_Localized: You seem to be trembling. You don't really want to fight, do you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818377
    m_Localized: Enough tricks! I'll cut through that pathetic shadow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818378
    m_Localized: ...Huh?! U-um...? N-no! I'm a really [punch]scary spirit[/punch]!
      Everyone trembles when they see me...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818379
    m_Localized: ...You're a very strange human. My true feelings... [pause=0.3]Usually
      everyone runs away in fear...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818380
    m_Localized: ...S-still, I have to fight... [tremble]I'll try not to hurt you
      too much[/tremble]...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818381
    m_Localized: ...See? Humans are all the same. My real feelings... [pause=0.35]You
      never even try to see them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818382
    m_Localized: ...Always making up your own assumptions... I don't care anymore.
      Do what you want, [punch]hurt yourself for all I care[/punch].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818383
    m_Localized: ...I won't be responsible if you get badly hurt. It really... [tremble]will
      hurt[/tremble]...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708325818384
    m_Localized: You're not the first to seek me out. [pause=0.25]And you won't be
      the last.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206976
    m_Localized: Still, I'll remember that you made it this far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206977
    m_Localized: '[shake]????[/shake] How are you still alive?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206978
    m_Localized: No, all right. This time I'll take a closer look at you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206979
    m_Localized: Could you [punch]stop coming back[/punch] already?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206980
    m_Localized: It's hard to keep reacting when you show up like this every time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206981
    m_Localized: I'm starting to get used to this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206982
    m_Localized: Though it's strange that your visits don't feel strange anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206983
    m_Localized: You're here. Sooner than I expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206984
    m_Localized: Maybe this time I can listen to a little more of your story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206985
    m_Localized: '[punch]Oooh!?[/punch] You got here pretty quickly!?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206986
    m_Localized: With that much time to spare, you could afford a little swagger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206987
    m_Localized: You look like you're about to collapse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206988
    m_Localized: Still, I'll give you credit for making it here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206989
    m_Localized: Wait, you're going to fight [tremble]in that condition[/tremble]?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206990
    m_Localized: I still can't tell whether you're reckless or persistent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206991
    m_Localized: You're back again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206992
    m_Localized: All right. Let's see how long you last this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206993
    m_Localized: Oh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206994
    m_Localized: So you are the hero I've heard about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206995
    m_Localized: <size=120%>[punch]Halt.[/punch]</size> Stop right there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206996
    m_Localized: Is it not proper to clean your shoes before entering my waterways?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206997
    m_Localized: One more step in those muddy shoes, and you'll ruin the floor my
      subjects spent three hours polishing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206998
    m_Localized: '[float]Behold.[/float]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334206999
    m_Localized: These crystal-clear waterways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207000
    m_Localized: <size=110%>[float]Behold.[/float] These spotless tiles.</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207001
    m_Localized: <size=120%>[wave]This is the pride of the Slime Kingdom.[/wave]</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207002
    m_Localized: <size=120%>[wave]The true beauty of the castle's underground waterways![/wave]</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207003
    m_Localized: And I am sovereign over all those [slowshake][rand_size=98,106]squishy[/rand_size][/slowshake]
      subjects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207004
    m_Localized: <size=120%>Melta, queen of the mighty slimes!</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207005
    m_Localized: These are truly magnificent waterways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207006
    m_Localized: <size=120%>[wave]Ohohohoho![/wave]</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207007
    m_Localized: Magnificent waterways, you say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708334207008
    m_Localized: Yes, an exceptionally accurate assessment!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401280
    m_Localized: My subjects would be delighted to hear that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401281
    m_Localized: No, they must be hearing it already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401282
    m_Localized: They are all watching from hiding, after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401283
    m_Localized: Very well. I shall grant you a defeat befitting your fine manners!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401284
    m_Localized: Pretty clean, for slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401285
    m_Localized: '[tremble]...For slimes?[/tremble]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401286
    m_Localized: Did you just [pause=0.2] [tremble]look down on[/tremble] my subjects?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401287
    m_Localized: <size=120%>Slimes are not shampoo, jelly, or alchemical ingredients!</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401288
    m_Localized: They move, they think,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401289
    m_Localized: They are proud citizens who even draw up their own shift schedules!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401290
    m_Localized: Very well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401291
    m_Localized: You shall receive a special lesson in etiquette first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401292
    m_Localized: His Majesty ordered us to show you some mercy, and I shall respect
      his wishes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401293
    m_Localized: But this is my kingdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401294
    m_Localized: If you wish to pass your queen, prove yourself worthy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401295
    m_Localized: Now, my adorable [slowshake][rand_size=98,106]subjects[/rand_size][/slowshake]!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401296
    m_Localized: <size=110%>[punch]Form ranks![/punch]</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401297
    m_Localized: <size=120%>[wave]Spread the formation![/wave]</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401298
    m_Localized: <size=130%>[punch]Squish that insolent hero flat!![/punch]</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401299
    m_Localized: Oh, you're here? What shall I hammer into shape today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401300
    m_Localized: Bring plenty of Magic Stones, and my hammer will forge you something
      spectacular!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401301
    m_Localized: I'd like an upgrade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401302
    m_Localized: Good! I like someone who gets straight to the point!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401303
    m_Localized: I haven't decided yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401304
    m_Localized: What? I got so excited to hammer away that I heated the forge red-hot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401305
    m_Localized: ...Tch, fine. Come back when you've decided. Next time, don't get
      my hopes up and back out, all right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401306
    m_Localized: I'll get the forge fired up. You figure out exactly what you want
      rebuilt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401307
    m_Localized: "Plenty of people marched out saying \u201CThis time is different,\u201D
      only to mop the castle floor with their faces and tumble back down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401308
    m_Localized: Come back beaten up again and I'll laugh my head off, so give it
      your best!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401309
    m_Localized: Once you're ready, head out through that door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401310
    m_Localized: 'Oh, fair warning: once you go through that door, it''s strictly
      one-way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401311
    m_Localized: Even if you cry outside because you forgot something, you can't
      come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401312
    m_Localized: See that pile? It's stuff left by people who fell into this pit,
      like you. I fixed it up so it's usable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401313
    m_Localized: Unless you plan to fight bare-handed, take one from the pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401314
    m_Localized: Once you've picked a weapon, warm up on the dummy beside it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401315
    m_Localized: Don't swing at thin air somewhere else and tumble back down again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401316
    m_Localized: Reduces dash cooldown by {reduction}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401317
    m_Localized: Increases gold gained from defeating enemies by {bonus}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401318
    m_Localized: Increases EXP gained by {bonus}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401319
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uBC1B\uC73C\uBA74]]: [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      {move_speed_bonus} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401320
    m_Localized: "\u25CF [[\uCE58\uBA85\uD0C0]] increases [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      by {move_speed_gain}\n\u25CF Stacks up to {max_move_speed_bonus}\n\u25CF Taking
      damage {neg:resets accumulated bonuses}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53708338401321
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {trigger}: [[{stat}]] {value} for {duration}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923555201024
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Every {bonus_move_step} [[\uCD94\uAC00 \uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      grants {crit_gain_per_step} [[\uCE58\uBA85\uD0C0 \uD655\uB960]]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556096
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Every {bonus_move_step} [[\uCD94\uAC00 \uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      grants {evasion_gain_per_step} [[\uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uD68C\uD53C\uD560 \uD655\uB960]]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556097
    m_Localized: "\u25CF {feather_count} feathers orbit you and attack enemies\n\u25CF
      Feather damage: {damage_coef} of [[\uACF5\uACA9\uB825]]\n\u25CF Orbit radius:
      {radius}\n\u25CF Base interval for hitting the same enemy: {hit_cooldown}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556098
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Bloom}\n\u25CF Kills during {em:Bloom}
      {pos:extend duration} by {extension_seconds}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556099
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Hits trigger an {em:additional lightning strike} on nearby
      enemies\n\u25CF Lightning damage: {lightning_damage}\n\u25CF Radius: {radius}\n{cooldown_line}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556100
    m_Localized: "\u25CF On kill: [[\uACF5\uACA9\uB825]] {attack_bonus} for {duration}\n\u25CF
      [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]] {move_speed_bonus}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556101
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Wings of Afterimage}\n\u25CF Kills
      with {em:Speed Strike} {pos:maintain Rush}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556102
    m_Localized: "\u25CF While HP is between {min_ratio} and {max_ratio}: [[{stat}]]
      {value}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556103
    m_Localized: "\u25CF Exclusive relic for {em:Wings of Afterimage}\n\u25CF Changes
      {em:Rush}'s movement speed bonus\n\u25CF On use: [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      {stage_0_bonus}\n\u25CF After {val:3 seconds}: [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      {stage_1_bonus}, total {stage_1_total}\n\u25CF After {val:6 seconds}: [[\uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4]]
      {stage_2_bonus}, total {stage_2_total}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556104
    m_Localized: Chill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556105
    m_Localized: Higher Chill strengthens the Sun Blade's basic attacks and contributes
      to the Resonance Finish requirement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556106
    m_Localized: Bloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556107
    m_Localized: Increases attack power, attack speed and movement speed, and enables
      dash slashes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556108
    m_Localized: Heat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556109
    m_Localized: Higher Heat strengthens the Moonshadow Blade's basic attacks and
      contributes to the Resonance Finish requirement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556110
    m_Localized: Alcohol Pool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556111
    m_Localized: Movement speed +25%, attack speed +40%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556112
    m_Localized: Counterattack Ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556113
    m_Localized: Taking damage briefly increases movement speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556114
    m_Localized: Lingering Sprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556115
    m_Localized: Defeating an enemy briefly increases movement speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556116
    m_Localized: Running Ledger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556117
    m_Localized: Critical hits build movement speed stacks, which reset when taking
      damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556118
    m_Localized: Limited Vision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556119
    m_Localized: Temporarily reduces your field of vision and activates the darkness
      mask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556120
    m_Localized: Obscured Vision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556121
    m_Localized: Temporarily obscures your vision while in contact with shadow mist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923735556122
    m_Localized: Hey, you! You can't pass here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750400
    m_Localized: No, I'm not blocking you. There's no road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750401
    m_Localized: The last hero's rampage blocked the road completely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750402
    m_Localized: We can't work until the construction payment arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750403
    m_Localized: Really? Then I'll start construction! Come back in about 3 days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750404
    m_Localized: You don't have enough Magic Stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750405
    m_Localized: You don't have enough Magic Stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750406
    m_Localized: It's you! Thanks, friend. Construction is underway thanks to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750407
    m_Localized: About {remaining_runs} remain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750408
    m_Localized: Construction is finished. Go take care of your business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750409
    m_Localized: Looks like you're short on construction funds. Bring more Magic
      Stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750410
    m_Localized: 'Oh! You''re the queen''s friend.

      She has allowed you to
      use the waterways. Just say the word.

      I''ll take you straight to the
      other side.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57923739750411
    m_Localized: 'You. Are you the hero?

      This is the entrance to the waterways.

      You
      can travel directly to your chosen region.

      I''d let you pass, but the
      queen hasn''t approved it yet.

      She says heroes pollute the water.

      Get
      her permission if you want to use it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
