  - m_Id: 61692179288068
    m_Localized: Use one of the three exercise stations! Strength boosts attack,
      the wheel boosts movement speed, and the log grants experience!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61692179288069
    m_Localized: Please take a parcel from the pile of boxes beside me. Parcels occupy
      relic slots and cannot be discarded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
