  - m_Id: 192954411945984
    m_Localized: Urgh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956131610624
    m_Localized: ...This might hurt a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956131610625
    m_Localized: Thrust!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956131610626
    m_Localized: Watch closely and dodge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956131610627
    m_Localized: I'll cut you down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956131610628
    m_Localized: This really hurts if it hits, you know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956144193536
    m_Localized: Here it comes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387840
    m_Localized: Let's see how far you can run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387841
    m_Localized: Try dodging this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387842
    m_Localized: Care for an explosion?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387843
    m_Localized: Coming down! Move!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387844
    m_Localized: Move, whelp!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387845
    m_Localized: Come back! We're not done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387846
    m_Localized: Come here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387847
    m_Localized: Get caught and you're dead!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387848
    m_Localized: Let your guard down, did you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387849
    m_Localized: Playtime is over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387850
    m_Localized: Time to get a little serious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387851
    m_Localized: Hey, hey! Don't throw me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387852
    m_Localized: You're not throwing me again, are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387853
    m_Localized: Wait! I'm not ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387854
    m_Localized: Now you call me back?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387855
    m_Localized: Fine, fine. Can't do without me, can you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387856
    m_Localized: Hmph. Just this once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387857
    m_Localized: See? You need me after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387858
    m_Localized: Aaaaaaah!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387859
    m_Localized: Say one more word. I dare you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387860
    m_Localized: ....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387861
    m_Localized: Blergh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387862
    m_Localized: How dare you... do this to me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387863
    m_Localized: I'm not a throwing sword!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387864
    m_Localized: Not enough... booze...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387865
    m_Localized: Bottoms up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387866
    m_Localized: Ahh~ Getting tipsy~!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387867
    m_Localized: Mmm~ That's good~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387868
    m_Localized: Ow, hot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387869
    m_Localized: Feeling dizzy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387870
    m_Localized: Better dodge this~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387871
    m_Localized: It won't open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387872
    m_Localized: It's locked tight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387873
    m_Localized: There might be another mechanism.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387874
    m_Localized: My equipment slots are full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387875
    m_Localized: I need to free up a slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387876
    m_Localized: I can't pick up any more right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387877
    m_Localized: It won't open from this side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387878
    m_Localized: I could open it from the other side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387879
    m_Localized: I'm glad you weren't hurt...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387880
    m_Localized: ...This might hurt a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387881
    m_Localized: Everyone, gather round!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387882
    m_Localized: Switch with me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387883
    m_Localized: Okay!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387884
    m_Localized: Oww... How dare you dodge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387885
    m_Localized: Ugh... I can't believe I lost...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387886
    m_Localized: I won't go easy on you next time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387887
    m_Localized: I'm glad you weren't hurt...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387888
    m_Localized: ...This might hurt a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387889
    m_Localized: Long ago, tensions between humans and the other races grew until
      they finally reached a breaking point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387890
    m_Localized: Just as a great war seemed inevitable, a mysterious Demon King appeared
      and united the other races into a mighty force. People called it the Demon
      King's army.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387891
    m_Localized: The frightened humans chose your childhood friend as their hero.
      Hoping to stop the threat before it grew, your friend set out alone for the
      Demon King's castle, only to vanish without a trace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387892
    m_Localized: Now, following the trail of your missing childhood friend, you too
      arrive at the gates of the Demon King's castle. And so your story begins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387893
    m_Localized: The Demon King fell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387894
    m_Localized: Without the Demon King, the other races that threatened the kingdom
      scattered. Reports soon arrived of the scattered groups causing trouble across
      the land.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387895
    m_Localized: You still do not know why your friend claimed to be the Demon King.
      Nevertheless, the kingdom welcomed you home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 192956148387896
    m_Localized: But... was this truly enough?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
